  "_readme": ["Food type assignments: every food in exactly one type, as item_dict keys (kubejs/startup_scripts/_lib/item_dict.js).", "server_scripts/tags/foodtypetags.js turns each type into #creativeengineering:food_type/<type>; a nested type", "(raw/meat/sliced) is also in its parents (raw/meat, raw, and #creativeengineering:food_type).", "Move an item by moving its key. python3 tools/food_catalog.py adds foods that are in no type yet and checks", "the rest; it never moves an item you placed. Reference: feature_writeup/food.md.", "excluded: edible items that are not food for tuning (never tagged). canned: can -> the foods it is made from", "(those land in #creativeengineering:canned_source)."],
